  - m_Id: 28446277645
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277646
    m_Localized: Fairy Maiden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277647
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277648
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277649
    m_Localized: Forced Laborer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277650
    m_Localized: '"If they tell me to die, then I''ll die. What good is living anyway?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277651
    m_Localized: Once ordinary farmers and fishermen dragged to Joseon as forced
      labor. Now they grip bloodied axes in a strange land. Their half-dead eyes
      and the way they swing that axe feel like a mute, righteous resistance against
      lives that were taken from them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277652
    m_Localized: Shrewd Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277653
    m_Localized: '"What would you trade for it? How about a kitchen knife for a thousand
      sacks of new rice?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277654
    m_Localized: "A trader with a knack for ruthless bargaining. Speak a wrong word
      and you\u2019ll lose more than your coin. Brazen and shameless, but his thick
      skin means he takes a bit more punishment than others."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277655
    m_Localized: Low-rank Bureaucrat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277656
    m_Localized: '"Nothing is bought or sold without my say-so. Of course not."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277657
    m_Localized: "A petty official who insists no trade is valid unless he approves.
      No remarkable skills \u2014 his office and rank are his authority. He scolds
      strangers and raises his hand with the confidence of someone who believes power
      itself justifies him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277658
    m_Localized: Imperial Zealot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277659
    m_Localized: "\"My life\u2019s length is no more than this inch of fuse. (grin)\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277660
    m_Localized: A fanatic who swore fealty to the Empire (or was brainwashed into
      it). When ordered, they run into the enemy with a bomb and detonate. Their
      lunatic devotion haunts the memory of anyone who saw them charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277661
    m_Localized: Imperial Archer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277662
    m_Localized: '"One arrow, one enemy. Numbers must be precise."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277663
    m_Localized: "An archer who pledged loyalty to the Emperor. Years of drill and
      indoctrination stripped away personal feeling; they aim and fire like a machine.
      Accuracy matters above all else \u2014 they will not lower their bow until
      life itself lets go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277664
    m_Localized: Propagandist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277665
    m_Localized: '"You know the answer already, right? I trust, or I trust!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277666
    m_Localized: "A mental instructor who implants the Empire\u2019s ideology. With
      words and rituals he makes allies, enemies, and villages kneel before doctrine.
      He wields language and magic like weapons, causing slow, corrosive despair."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277667
    m_Localized: Scion Swordsman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277668
    m_Localized: "\"It\u2019s our fate; I\u2019m not afraid of it.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277669
    m_Localized: "A martial heir born into a long line of duellists and prosecutors.
      He fights under the weight of family, tradition and duty. Uses taunts to draw
      enemy blows and shield his allies \u2014 the battlefield is his stage, and
      he knows honor\u2019s final act may be death."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277670
    m_Localized: Imperial Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277671
    m_Localized: "\"Any hand that reaches for the Emperor \u2014 I\u2019ll cleave
      it off!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277672
    m_Localized: "The Emperor\u2019s closest protector. Armored and implacable, faster
      than a spear and harder than a shield. For him, guarding is best done by striking
      first \u2014 anyone who reaches toward the Emperor falls by his blade."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277673
    m_Localized: Imperial Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277674
    m_Localized: '"The Sun never rests; neither may I."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277675
    m_Localized: "Spotted during brutal labor and trained into a human weapon for
      the Emperor. He believes his second life is a gift from the throne. The weapon
      he carries \u2014 musket \u2014 is a symbol of his obedience. He will set Joseon\u2019s
      fields alight under the Emperor\u2019s command."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277676
    m_Localized: Sun Incarnation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277677
    m_Localized: "\"I do not lift a sword. I merely show the Sun\u2019s will.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277678
    m_Localized: "A leader of the Empire\u2019s advance known as a \u2018Sun Incarnation\u2019.
      His presence reduces incoming damage for allies. Beyond combat prowess, his
      closeness to the Emperor elevates troop morale \u2014 being near him is enough
      to stiffen resolve."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277679
    m_Localized: Cult Settler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277680
    m_Localized: "\"If you want the land tilled, I\u2019ll till it; if you want throats
      cut, I\u2019ll do that too!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277681
    m_Localized: "Civilians misled by a fanatic faith who crossed the seas to found
      a new kingdom in Joseon. Brainwashed by their leader, they obey any order \u2014
      be it settlement or pillage. Their fanaticism makes them dangerous pawns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277682
    m_Localized: Abused Cult Laborer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277683
    m_Localized: "\"I\u2019ll do anything you say\u2026 Just spare me\u2014twenty
      lashes today, please?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277684
    m_Localized: "Forced into menial tasks by the cult. Where their family and home
      were taken, despair replaced rage; the cult\u2019s beatings and exhaustion
      made them comply. They\u2019re used as expendable fodder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277685
    m_Localized: Poison Carrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277686
    m_Localized: "\"I\u2019ll do whatever you order\u2026 Please, just\u2014let me
      rest.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277687
    m_Localized: Another broken soul, tasked with dangerous jobs like transporting
      toxins. Long exposure left their skin sallow; they barely feel pain. When they
      die, trapped poisons detonate, leaving a 20% chance to poison nearby foes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277688
    m_Localized: Cult Vanguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277689
    m_Localized: '"Not even a bug shall approach near our prophet!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277690
    m_Localized: "Lowest-rank cult soldier assigned to guard the prophet. Their title
      boosts morale oddly, making them spirited defenders. Not especially strong,
      but fanatically protective \u2014 they will fire frenzied shots to protect
      their leader."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277691
    m_Localized: Cult Scout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277692
    m_Localized: "\"Keep the faith aflame! I am the prophet\u2019s eyes!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277693
    m_Localized: "A long-range recon unit who radiates fervor, granting nearby allies
      a \u2018fervor\u2019 (or \u2018resolve\u2019) state. Armed with a small gun
      for distance and a spear for close work. Slightly tougher than the basic guardian
      thanks to light armor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277694
    m_Localized: Inquisitor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28446277695
    m_Localized: '"Infidel, pay with blood for your sins!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471936
    m_Localized: They believe purging heresy is divine justice. They execute those
      who stray from doctrine, convinced that blood cleanses sin. Their fanatic gaze
      holds a single conviction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471937
    m_Localized: Mad Demolitionist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471938
    m_Localized: "\"A golden revelation whispered in my ear \u2014 burn it all away!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471939
    m_Localized: "Once a miner, trapped in explosives while seeking veins underground.
      Now consumed by visions of gold, he straps himself with bombs and rushes the
      enemy. Death isn\u2019t an end but proof \u2014 and he smiles as he detonates."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471940
    m_Localized: Cult Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471941
    m_Localized: "\"Advance! Our steps will open the god\u2019s path!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471942
    m_Localized: "Formerly a colonization vanguard turned into a harbinger of demolition
      by the cult. Slow but solid; his charge is more ritual than mere movement,
      strengthened by the belief that it\u2019s divine will."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471943
    m_Localized: Torturer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471944
    m_Localized: '"Confess, or scream until you do."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471945
    m_Localized: Believes divine will is revealed through the agony of the heretic.
      Torture is purification; screams are redemption. His axe is not for killing
      alone, but for forcing confession.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471946
    m_Localized: Brainwashed Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471947
    m_Localized: '"Anything. Remove anything that approaches."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471948
    m_Localized: Originally hired to protect locals, now reprogrammed into cult loyalty.
      With sword and obsession, he becomes unyielding and remorseless in combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471949
    m_Localized: Cult Preacher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471950
    m_Localized: "\"You can be healed\u2014if only you would believe.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471951
    m_Localized: "A false savior who heals while chaining souls to the cult. His
      staff\u2019s power is not purely medicine but ritual control, binding patients
      in faith and dependence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471952
    m_Localized: "Zealous Executioner Zer\xF3el"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471953
    m_Localized: '"Doubt is sin, and my blade ends sin."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471954
    m_Localized: "Cold and doctrinaire, Zer\xF3el roots out heresy by strict rule
      and ritual. His taunts provoke fanatic responses and amplify his own power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471955
    m_Localized: Punisher Edward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471956
    m_Localized: '"My hammer stamps the seal of justice. Are you ready?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471957
    m_Localized: "A holy-sounding warrior whose \u2018truth\u2019 is punishment.
      Edward embodies the cult\u2019s righteous destruction; his hammer is salvation
      turned into a ruinous force."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471958
    m_Localized: The Absolute, Henry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471959
    m_Localized: '"Even your souls will fuel my temple."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471960
    m_Localized: "The cult\u2019s monstrous leader. A master of persuasion and eerie
      charisma, Henry plunders souls and wealth while preaching salvation. Humble
      smiles hide venomous prayers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471961
    m_Localized: Desert Mercenary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471962
    m_Localized: "\"Don\u2019t compare me to small-time ruffians, please.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471963
    m_Localized: "A professional soldier from a harsh desert homeland, recruited
      for pay. Trained since childhood, she\u2019s proud and blunt, packing high
      base attack and HP. Efficient, ruthless, and clean in her kills."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471964
    m_Localized: Desert Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471965
    m_Localized: '"(shing) This is just a warm-up."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471966
    m_Localized: Another mercenary from the same wasteland, trained for mobility.
      Expert at hit-and-run tactics, she uses a long spear to both strike and vault
      obstacles, breaking defensive lines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471967
    m_Localized: Desert Assassin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471968
    m_Localized: "\"\u2026You see me? Hmph. Tonight, I\u2019ll let it slide.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471969
    m_Localized: "Elite stealth mercenary, legendary for disappearance and sudden
      kills. Usually unseen, but oddly overexposed in Joseon \u2014 some say the
      golden fields loosen her discipline."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471970
    m_Localized: Desert Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471971
    m_Localized: '"This is both medicine and prayer. It stops the bleeding, you hear?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471972
    m_Localized: "A healer blending tribal medicine and ritual. She stops blood,
      mends bone, and calms fear using polished crystals that glow \u2014 her healing
      is more rite than remedy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471973
    m_Localized: The Phantom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471974
    m_Localized: "\"Don\u2019t think about surviving. Your name has already been
      taken.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471975
    m_Localized: "Within the Moorish mercenary ranks, a phantom-like killer who specializes
      in solitary infiltration and mass slaughter. Her blades carry poison that topples
      crowds; she sticks to the enemy\u2019s breath and strikes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471976
    m_Localized: Elite Pathfinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471977
    m_Localized: "\"Whatever blocks us\u2026 we go through it. That\u2019s our way.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471978
    m_Localized: "A top reconnaissance veteran who moves across the battlefield and
      penetrates deepest lines. Her flexible spear is both weapon and pole-vault;
      her silhouette is a mirage \u2014 gone before you can act."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471979
    m_Localized: Desert Trooper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471980
    m_Localized: "\"Stop and you die. It\u2019s that simple.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471981
    m_Localized: "A frontline brawler who clears paths with shield and saber. Rapid
      and relentless, she inspires swiftness in allies \u2014 in the desert, stopping
      means death, and she never stops."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471982
    m_Localized: Moorish Warlord Demzimoor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471983
    m_Localized: '"Stand behind me. Not a blade will touch you."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471984
    m_Localized: "Legendary mercenary captain who reshaped battlefield tactics. A
      living bulwark \u2014 she grants an unbreakable aura to allies and transforms
      a band of mercs into a moving fortress."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471985
    m_Localized: Orator Catherine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471986
    m_Localized: '"Those who defy my voice shall kneel."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28450471987
    m_Localized: She no longer stains the battlefield with blood but with words.
      With sermons and a steely gaze, she cowes enemies into submission. Her prophetic
      tome contains curses and promises; kneeling is the common result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
